{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408470/extras/99dcb811588818e1c4bea519c5d4d5bc.avif?t=1759518016\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408470/extras_big/99dcb811588818e1c4bea519c5d4d5bc.avif?t=1759518016 width=800 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious post discovered on a Japanese internet forum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;7 Days Shrine&quot; - an ancient ritual said to grant any wish without fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It speaks of a tradition of visiting an old Shinto shrine deep in the Japanese mountains for seven consecutive days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the &quot;7 Days Shrine&quot; ritual has rules that must be followed:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue your shrine visits for seven consecutive days</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not leave the mountain during the ritual</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not let yourself be seen by anyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not look into the darkness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to undertake the 7 Days Shrine ritual?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcFeatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;7 Days Shrine&quot; is a short walking simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For seven days, you'll traverse mountain paths and pay your respects at the shrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As each day passes, anxiety and fear slowly consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you on the seventh day...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the truth with your own eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 c